  "error_identification": "Turn 1 contains redundant startEngine calls (3 total invocations) and pressBrakePedal/lockDoors are out of sequence relative to delta2's prescribed atomic block order. However, these deviations did not prevent state correctness or cause evaluation failure.",
  "root_cause_analysis": "The model prioritized completing all requested operations (engine start + status display) over strict adherence to delta2's startup sequence atomicity. Redundant startEngine calls suggest the model re-invoked after each prerequisite rather than executing the full block once. The narrative summaries are conversational additions unrelated to tool correctness.",
